    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nExceptional Residential Site in One of Galway's Most Prestigious Addresses\n\nO'Donnellan & Joyce are delighted to present this rare opportunity to acquire a substantial residential site in the exclusive Lioscarraig development on the ever-desirable Threadneedle Road, Salthill.\n\nTucked away within a quiet cul-de-sac, No. 5 Lioscarraig occupies a prime corner site extending to approximately 0.91 acres (0.37 hectares) on Folio GY117915F. \n\nSurrounded by an exclusive collection of detached homes, this exceptional site offers the perfect setting to create a truly outstanding residence in one of Galway's most sought-after locations.\n\nResidential opportunities of this calibre are exceptionally rare. Just moments from Salthill Village and the iconic Promenade, the location offers the perfect balance of privacy, convenience and coastal living. \n\nMagnificent beaches, scenic coastal walks and a vibrant selection of cafés, restaurants and local amenities are all within easy walking distance.\n\nThe property also enjoys close proximity to Pearse Stadium, together with some of Galway's most respected primary and secondary schools, including Taylor's Hill, Salerno Secondary School and St. Enda's College, making it an ideal location for families.\n\nGalway City Centre, the Latin Quarter and the West End are all just a ten-minute drive away, offering an outstanding choice of shopping, dining and cultural attractions, while the University of Galway, University Hospital Galway and an extensive range of sporting and recreational facilities are all easily accessible.\n\nCombining an enviable address, generous site size and exceptional convenience, this outstanding site presents a unique opportunity to secure a premium residential setting in one of Galway's most prestigious locations.\n\nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database \n\nFor Further details please contact our office on 091-564212 \nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\n\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \n\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact. Whilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> * Prime residential site extending to c. 0.91 acres.</li><li> * Prestigious Threadneedle Road address.</li><li> * Exclusive cul-de-sac of detached homes.</li><li> * Corner site with excellent potential.</li><li> * Walking distance to Salthill Promenade.</li><li> * Close to Pearse Stadium and excellent schools.</li><li> * Minutes from Galway City Centre.</li><li> * Easy access to University of Galway & UHG.</li><li> * Quiet, private and highly sought-after setting.</li><li> * Rare opportunity in a premier residential location.</ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Colm O'Donnellan"
      }
    ],
